hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah ne aasmaano aur zameen ko paida karne se do hazaar saal pehle ek kitaab likhi, jismein se do aayatein nazil ki jin se Surah Al-Baqarah ko khatam kiya. Aur teen raaton tak kisi ghar mein yeh padhi nahi jaati magar shaitan uske qareeb nahi hota."
"17","[AI-translation] Abu Ishaq se riwayat hai, jis shakhs ne Ali ko suna, woh kehte hain: Main yeh nahi samajhta ke koi aqalmand shakhs so sakta hai yahan tak ke Surah Al-Baqarah ke aakhir ki yeh aayatein na padh le, aur beshak yeh Arsh ke neeche ke khazane se hain."
"18","[AI-translation] Allah ka Ism-e-Aazam, jis se pukaara jaye toh woh ijabat farmata hai, Quran ki teen suraton mein hai: (Al-Baqarah), (Aal-e-Imran), aur (Ta-Ha) mein."
